{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a6d623c76baf0c12715ca6d2a6b1f2df4d803665a27e0bb25787a59d75ec7bc5", "ja": "（今日は幼稚園でライブだ。子ども達とすぐに\n仲良くなった環は、本番までみんなと遊んでいる……）", "zh": "（今天要在幼儿园举办演唱会。很快就和孩子们熟悉起来的环，\n一直和大家玩到正式演出前……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "c239f7acb158f3b073cabccfce87809d9aacf7b25fad69b8667ec6147aae1450", "ja": "うう、おやぶん……ぐすっ。", "zh": "呜呜，老大……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ec159c18a5078b51207fa071dd60f6af4d2d623249c036e6adf437dcdb74f799", "ja": "た、環！？\nどうした？　何があったんだ？", "zh": "环！？  \n怎么了？发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "c1f70d72b9ec83ec9367c98d13160a67f2d8feeaaeeaa91dbd1117c2a8fce342", "ja": "あのね……みんなと一緒に、ライブで使うお星さまを\n持って歌ってたら、男の子に取られちゃった……。", "zh": "那个啊……环和大家一起拿着演出要用的小星星\n唱歌的时候，被一个小男孩给抢走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "980b0705eb64d26db0c285ff276c3f0f2d469c07526cd5682075c8b0efaba989", "ja": "たまきが「返して」って追いかけたけど……\nぜんぜん返してくれないんだ。", "zh": "环追着他说“还给我”，可是……他完全不肯还。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b102b3c133386a48174048eba2c4e30057730c33d093fca90b614a64579de29b", "ja": "な、なるほど……。なあ、環？\n男の子は何か言ったりしなかったか？", "zh": "原、原来如此……对了，环？\n那个男孩子有没有说过什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "6ae3967a10bbaa227304b6dda9df46e9507becd135bd1e63166d2088af07d609", "ja": "えっ？　うーん、何か言ってたかな……。\nあっ。たまきが楽しそうだからって言ってた気がする。", "zh": "诶？嗯——他有说什么来着……  \n啊。我记得他说，好像是因为环看起来很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1007_p", "source_sha256": "de27b49b3fe97b84e85277f3202261b4405af7aecb5bb6e2fa0cbe8f26abe955", "ja": "そうか……。もしかしたら、\nその男の子は、環のことが好きなのかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊……说不定，那个男孩子喜欢环也不一定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "4b88f3e220f1e5d1869af6214041b27dff7f010dc2c5d17d5188ea9125ed29b2", "ja": "えー、そうなの！？　でも……好きだから、\nたまきにイジワルするの？　なんか悲しいぞ……。", "zh": "诶——是这样的吗！？可是……正因为喜欢，\n才要欺负小环吗？总觉得好难过啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a5b941e1f266f9d10ce034f578d7884ff5af78ca5a0de45dc9cf2be595ee99f5", "ja": "うん、そうだな。男の子は、大好きな環に\n気づいてほしくて、イジワルしちゃったんだと思う。", "zh": "嗯，是这样。那个男孩子因为很喜欢小环，想让她注意到自己，所以才故意欺负她的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "a5e880e1ee08459292f5f94c3bfbcfdb84fa1bf00e4de3ba3c0bf62bed3fac87", "ja": "そっか……。おやぶん……\nどうしたらたまきのお星さま、返してくれるかな？", "zh": "这样啊……老大……要怎么做，他才会把小环的星星还回来呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4cf719d728cc1ae59d416040e1a30ec8cb687e38fce858b6fbe6f1319dd94071", "ja": "そうだな……。男の子の立場になって考えてみようか。\n環だったら、何をされたら星を返そうと思う？", "zh": "是啊……站在那个男孩子的立场上想想看吧。  \n如果是环的话，要怎样才会想把星星还回来呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "66345a61af5808fc95745ba7ac64186550fde0effebec8f14b1c0f74e580b268", "ja": "たまきなら？　うーん……あっ！\n後ろから近づいて、こしょこしょーってするかも！", "zh": "换作环的话？嗯……啊！\n我可能会从背后靠近，挠他痒痒——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "efcb545eeb682386ffbfb64970a402ac14b160b5bd0253dc6921e6953faaf949", "ja": "こっそりつまみ食いしちゃった時、ばあちゃんが\nいつも、こしょこしょーってするんだ。", "zh": "偷偷偷吃的时候，奶奶总是会挠我痒痒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "e4a88c12bbee90d020ae5501d50eba4ddb87c138e133551411c83ea01c78751a", "ja": "たまき、いつもビックリして……。食べてたお団子、\nばあちゃんに取られちゃった。えへへ……。", "zh": "环总是会被吓一跳……正在吃的团子，被奶奶拿走了。嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e38ea931edc9b378d990e6842251e6a2a1f867980fb13df2d3ee8a2a9c2ec363", "ja": "くすぐるってことか……。男の子も、\n環みたいにビックリして返してくれるかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来是要挠痒痒啊……男孩子说不定也会像小环一样，被吓得还回来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "46c47378a995b8e7278084f51c4e4fd6b38a615b1460cd8a4d2deeee61e7dd88", "ja": "うん！　たまき、早速やってみる！　い～っぱい\nこしょこしょして、お星さま取り返すぞー！　くふふ♪", "zh": "嗯！环这就试试！要挠好多好多下，把小星星夺回来——！咯咯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0313_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c5d6bc78daedaae8926947c1aaab959216b75a28ad72eea55643e39f8e1e6a9d", "ja": "えっ、いっぱい！？　環、ほどほどにな……！\n……だ、大丈夫かな？", "zh": "诶，要弄很多！？ 环，适可而止啊……！\n……没、没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
